                                "sense_id": "27257147-a191-3298-931c-d973913815f0",
                                "text": "Don't do anything gooseish, will you?' 'No, and don't you do anything gooseish either!' she retorted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c508bb8c-ceeb-4933-bab8-b57c77369c2e",
                                "sense_id": "27257147-a191-3298-931c-d973913815f0",
                                "text": "“Don't be goosish.” Lucy was studying the room."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c41c5db-d12d-45f6-a848-c93116b588bf",
                                "sense_id": "27257147-a191-3298-931c-d973913815f0",
                                "text": "[…] She was always gooseish.” She waved her fan languidly as they made their way through the crowd until they reached the other side of the room."
                            }
                        ]
